  "name": "Bering Sea Times Series Data (1996-1999)",
  "description": "During the 1996-1999 the following \"Times Series Data\" were collected: 21 RCM7s, 2 RCM9s, 64 MTRs, 20 Seacats, 3 Pressure guages, 3 SPAAMs 1 Weather bouy , 3024 CTDs\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.\n\nPurpose: To explore and measure through the 1996-1999 Bering Sea Times Series Data",
